{"id":"vod_sn_35773","vodId":"35773","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"盾之勇者成名录第一季","name_cn":"盾之勇者成名录第一季","date":"2019-01-01","year":"2019","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/1e9965097b9a2c1c480ab00898970ab5.jpg"},"summary":"岩谷尚文（石川界人 配音）是一个内心里充满了正义感的青年，对世界上发生的很多不公平的事情都深感愤怒。一次偶然中，他被传送到了异世界里，成为了能够使用各种各样不同功能的盾牌的盾之勇者。本以为可以就此展开伸张正义的旅途，哪知道刚刚过去几天，他就经历了战友的背叛，而且丢掉了所有的财物。尚文发誓再也不要信任这个世界里的任何人了。　　就在这个节骨眼上，尚文的面前出现了一位名为拉芙塔利亚（濑户麻沙美 配音）的少女，拉芙塔利亚是一名奴隶，尚文决定用金钱来换取忠诚将她买下，在相处的过程中，拉芙塔利亚渐渐爱上了自己的主人。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 15:37:32","playable":true,"episodeCount":25,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/rck1iFGxxK1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/feHWMbgGst1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/wjvh0xnhPB1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/pJHtZJ6xMm1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/236U86D8sm1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/y4GnGNh7pP1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/S2FsGpBqsV1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/AjRAbtmjzy1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/AQDmpu2s3G1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/B6pwH20HMF1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/cqAZqJZkhd1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/9ae5wSRQpR1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/zwiY53iiW31/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第14集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/zAzN6aYAdj1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第15集","url":"https://v6.rs